@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title PUT /api/workspace/v1/messenger/message_reactions/[reaction_uuid]
actor "Клиент" as Client
participant "WorkspaceMessageReactionController\nRestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\nканонические строки + привязки" as DB
queue "Transactional outbox\n+ вывод типизированных задач" as Outbox
participant "Worker scope=message\nexact lease + fencing" as Worker
database "Готовые проекции\nпривязки контейнеров" as Projection
database "Хранилище публичных событий" as Events
participant "Диспетчер WebSocket" as Dispatcher
actor "Клиент WebSocket" as WS
Client -> API: PUT /api/workspace/v1/messenger/message_reactions/{reaction_uuid}
API -> DB: resolve applicable public placement;\ncheck active membership + generation
API -> DB: update one canonical fact + immutable outbox event
DB --> API: фиксация транзакции
API --> Client: успешный публичный ответ
DB ->> Outbox: зафиксированное событие
Outbox ->> Worker: immutable reaction_snapshot(outbox_event_uuid)\nбез coalescing
Worker -> Worker: claim (project_id, canonical_message_uuid)\nlease + fencing
Worker -> Projection: MESSAGE.reactions + reaction_users
Worker -> Events: message_reaction.updated + message.updated\nатомарно в одной DB transaction с проекцией
Events ->> Dispatcher: зафиксированная готовая строка
Dispatcher ->> WS: отправка / повтор / воспроизведение
note over API,Worker
  Topic lock не используется; retry/backoff + DLQ/reaper.
  Способ восстановить placement context для reaction_uuid остаётся
  централизованным OPEN-решением; arbitrary placement запрещён.
end note
@enduml
